      55.25,
      455.92,
      549.77,
      538.99
    ],
    "text": "The roads and lanes which are deem to be owned by Kuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha in which are relevant noti\ufb01 cation is included published in the Gazette No. 2415/41 dated 18.12.2024 under the terms made by section 24 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of the 1987 as the \"orders on the preparation of plans and posting of notices showing the list of names of the roads and lanes\" maintained by the Pradeshiya Sabha of Sabaragamuwa Province as the Honourable Governor of Sabaragamuwa Province has publish in the Special Gazette No. 2316/20 dated 24 January 2023 and it is hereby published for the public that it has been decided under decision No. 17 of 30th May 2025 that all said road and lanes shall be owned by Kuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha as because of any case has not been assigned in a competent court on the date \ufb01 xed by the said noti\ufb01 cation.",
