      551.92,
      549.78,
      586.99
    ],
    "text": "It is further announced that all roads and lanes included therein shall be deemed to be roads lanes established by the Kuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha under sub section (5) of section 24 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act list of those road and lanes is included in the schedule here.",
